{"ticker":"NMDC","symbol":"NMDC","instrumentId":3101003,"name":"Nmdc","industry":"NSE-Mining-Metal Ores","about":"NMDC Ltd. (National Mineral Development Corporation) is India's largest iron ore producer and a leading public sector enterprise in the mining industry. The company operates extensive iron ore mines in Chhattisgarh and Karnataka, providing essential raw materials for the steel industry. NMDC also engages in the exploration and development of other minerals like copper, rock phosphate, limestone, and diamond. With a commitment to sustainable mining practices, NMDC plays a key role in supporting India’s infrastructure development and industrial growth. The company is also expanding its portfolio into steel production, contributing to the country's economic progress while maintaining high environmental and operational standards.","website":"www.nmdc.co.in","location":"Hyderabad, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:45:16.006Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":68.2,"changePct":-0.058616647127772634,"week52High":96.04,"week52Low":66.35},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹59,960 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹32,387 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"3,428,809,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"736"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"2,411,006,298"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"5.13%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"1.76"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.6"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.02"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.03"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-3%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"8.06"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"4–14"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"21.9%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"5.68"},{"label":"Volume","value":"22,339,522"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"15,137,985"},{"label":"Master score","value":"35"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"27"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"29"},{"label":"Group rank","val